The Hero's Shield from the [[Era of the Great Sea]] appears in {{BotW}}. It is obtained randomly when 30th Anniversary series {{TWW|-}}-themed Princess Zelda [[amiibo]] is used is scanned using the [[Amiibo (Ability)|amiibo]] [[Rune]]. Multiple can be obtained through repeatedly scanning the Rune. It is said this Shield was the favorite of a hero who travelled the open seas.<ref name="Inventory"/> This Shield was apparently a family heirloom, passed down through generations.<ref name="Inventory"/>

Being made of metal, the Hero's Shield will conduct [[Electricity]] and attract [[Lightning]] if it is equipped during a [[Thunderstorm]]. It will also sink if it is dropped in [[Water (Terrain)|Water]]. However, it can be picked up with the [[Magnesis]] Rune, and it will not burn like wooden Shields do when exposed to [[Fire]] or a [[Scorching Climate]].

